{%- doc -%}
  Outputs a product's vendor for display. A vendor whose name contains "Haramain" (store data inherited from another shop, still
  on the gift bags) is shown as "MOMENTS", per the approved decision for generic gift bags. This is a display rule only: nothing in
  the store is changed. The real fix (renaming the vendor, which also changes the vendor-based smart collections) waits for approval.

  @param {string} vendor - The product vendor.

  @example
  {% render 'vendor-name', vendor: product.vendor %}
{%- enddoc -%}

{%- assign vendor_check = vendor | downcase -%}
{%- if vendor_check contains 'haramain' -%}
  {{- shop.name -}}
{%- else -%}
  {{- vendor -}}
{%- endif -%}
